# Kanto's Hall of Fame (FireRed's MUS_HALL_OF_FAME): a stately, glowing piece in C major, a trumpet's long phrases
# over warm held strings, a slow bass and timpani on the strong beats, for the ceremony in which a new Champion's team is
# recorded (the room itself plays slow_pallet). A place indoors plays the same by day and night. Original composition
# for this game (plan 19 · K7; played by the ceremony since plan 19 · K8).
title Hall of Fame
tempo 84
meter 4/4
reverb 0.42
night none

